@startuml
title Variant A — Primary push delivery
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Bank service\n+ source outbox" as Bank
participant "Ingress API" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Orchestrator\n+ outbox relay" as O
queue "RabbitMQ" as Q
participant "Push Adapter" as A
participant "FCM / APNs" as P
participant "Mobile app" as App
participant "Receipt API" as R

Bank -> Bank : Commit transaction + source outbox
Bank -> API : POST stable event_id, recipient, template
API -> DB : BEGIN; insert event key, notification, outbox; COMMIT
DB --> API : Durable commit (t0)
API --> Bank : 202 notification_id
O -> DB : Read intake outbox; commit route + planned attempt
O -> Q : Publish SendPush(attempt_id)
Q --> O : Publisher confirm
O -> DB : Mark outbox published
Q -> A : SendPush(attempt_id)
A -> DB : Check generation and no confirmation; claim DISPATCHING
DB --> A : Permission committed
A -> P : Send push with notification_id (t1)
P --> A : Accepted + provider_message_id
A -> DB : Commit WAITING_RECEIPT
A -> Q : Consumer ACK
note over A,P : Provider acceptance is not final delivery
P -> App : Push notification
App -> App : Deduplicate ID; persist local inbox
App -> R : Authenticated ACK(notification_id, attempt token)
R -> DB : Commit receipt + outbox
R --> App : 200
O -> DB : Lock notification; validate evidence;
O -> DB : Commit CONFIRMED + transition (t2);
note over O,DB : Cancel unclaimed steps. Receipt outbox processing
note over O,DB : is idempotent and recoverable after a crash.
@enduml
